      <section class="biography" aria-label="About">

        <p>
          I am a researcher / engineer in computer networking, a
          Project Assistant Professor at Keio University, and a
          Ph.D. student at the Graduate School of Media and Governance,
          Keio University.
        </p>

        <p>
          My research focuses on computer networks, particularly mobile
          networks and edge computing. I am interested in designing network
          architectures that integrate mobile networks and computing
          infrastructure for 5G and beyond.
        </p>
